OL,3,GNEWSALessons learned after school
OL,4,Aclosure, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FLessons have been learnt after a
OL,7,Fprimary school closed when the removal
OL,8,Fof a zebra crossing sparked safety
OL,9,Fconcerns, a council said.
OL,11,FLakenheath Community Primary School in
OL,12,FSuffolk closed on Tuesday when
OL,13,Fgovernors said there had been "several
OL,14,Fnear-miss incidents" outside its gates.
OL,16,FSuffolk County Council said some of the
OL,17,Fhighways issues had been "out of our
OL,18,Fcontrol" and the school reopened on
OL,19,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
