OL,3,GNEWSALessons learned after school
OL,4,Aclosure, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Cooke, assistant director of
OL,7,Fspecial education and disabilities and
OL,8,Finclusion at the council, told BBC
OL,9,FRadio Suffolk the school was safe again
OL,10,Fand measures had been implemented such
OL,11,Fas staggered start times for pupils.
